# S0p hold twin of refused_load.prog (OD-L3-119 item 2): the same input under the hold W schedule,
# header bit 1 only.
start hold
# The clock moved back past the tip's time + 2 h: the load is refused and the session is down;
# moving it forward and restarting brings it back.
extend main 2
warp 100
restart clean
extend main 1
invalidate main@-0
time 200
restart clean
extend main 1
